* **Failure Mechanism:** Standard `Tesseract.js` initiates an asynchronous HTTP `fetch()` to `https://tessdata.projectnaptha.com/4.0.0/eng.traineddata.gz`. In a truly sovereign, air-gapped deployment with physical network isolation (no internet gateway), this HTTP request fails with a connection timeout or DNS resolution error after 30 seconds.
* **Architectural Hardening:**
